    "topic": "The Greek Definite Article",
    "explanation": "The Greek article (ὁ, ἡ, τό) is more versatile than English the. It agrees in gender, number, case with its noun. It can make nouns definite, function as pronoun, substantivize adjectives, and indicate abstract concepts.",
